=#64748b;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#334155;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;endArrow=ERmany;endFill=0;startArrow=ERone;startFill=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="e1" target="e4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="l2" value="1:N" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#64748b;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#334155;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;endArrow=ERmany;endFill=0;startArrow=ERone;startFill=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="e2" target="e3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="l3" value="1:N" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#64748b;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#334155;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;endArrow=ERmany;endFill=0;startArrow=ERone;startFill=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="e2" target="e5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="l4" value="1:N" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#64748b;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#334155;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;endArrow=ERmany;endFill=0;startArrow=ERone;startFill=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="e4" target="e5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="verbal_note_erd-5" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:17px;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:14px;&quot;&gt;SOẠN CÂU HỎI VÀ BÀI TẬP&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:1.65;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:12px;&quot;&gt;• questions là ngân hàng câu hỏi thuộc giáo viên; mỗi câu có loại MCQ, FILL, MATCH hoặc ORDER.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:12px;&quot;&gt;• question_options chứa lựa chọn cho MCQ; payload JSON chứa dữ liệu đặc thù các dạng còn lại.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:12px;&quot;&gt;• exercises là bộ câu hỏi có thể dùng lại nhiều lần, không phải lần giao bài.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:12px;&quot;&gt;• exercise_questions là bảng nối N–N giữa exercises và questions; lưu điểm và thứ tự của câu trong bài.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:12px;&quot;&gt;• Sửa câu hỏi hoặc bài tập gốc không thay đổi assignment đã giao vì nội dung giao được chụp riêng.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:12px;&quot;&gt;• Giáo viên chỉ quản lý câu hỏi và bài tập của mình.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F1F5F9;strokeColor=#94A3B8;fontColor=#0F172A;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=18;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1280" y="95" width="540" height="730" as="geometry" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="erd-6" name="06 - Giao bài &amp; chấm điểm"><mxGraphModel dx="1500" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1900" pageHeight="1500" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0" /><mxCell id="1" parent="0" /><mxCell id="e1" value="&lt;b&gt;classes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr/&gt;PK id&lt;br/&gt;FK teacher_id" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=13;fillColor=#dcfce7;strokeColor=#64748b;fontColor=#172033;fontSize=13;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="95" width="300" height="118" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e2" value="&lt;b&gt;exercises&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr/&gt;PK id&lt;br/&gt;FK owner_id" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=13;fillColor=#f3e8ff;strokeColor=#64748b;fontColor=#172033;fontSize=13;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="480" y="95" width="300" height="118" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e3" value="&lt;b&gt;assignments&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr/&gt;PK id&lt;br/&gt;FK exercise_id&lt;br/&gt;FK class_id&lt;br/&gt;FK assigned_by&lt;br/&gt;start_at, due_at&lt;br/&gt;time_limit_minutes, pass_score&lt;br/&gt;status ACTIVE/CANCELLED" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=13;fillColor=#ffe4e6;strokeColor=#64748b;fontColor=#172033;fontSize=13;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="890" y="95" width="300" height="216" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e4" value="&lt;b&gt;assignment_questions&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr/&gt;PK id&lt;br/&gt;FK assignment_id&lt;br/&gt;FK source_question_id (optional)&lt;br/&gt;type, snapshot&lt;br/&gt;points, sort_order, section_name" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=13;fillColor=#ffe4e6;strokeColor=#64748b;fontColor=#172033;fontSize=13;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="386" width="300" height="168" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e5" value="&lt;b&gt;assignment_overrides&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr/&gt;PK id&lt;br/&gt;FK assignment_id&lt;br/&gt;FK student_id&lt;br/&gt;extended_due_at, extra_attempts&lt;br/&gt;FK granted_by" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=13;fillColor=#ffe4e6;strokeColor=#64748b;fontColor=#172033;fontSize=13;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="480" y="386" width="300" height="168" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e6" value="&lt;b&gt;attempts&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr/&gt;PK id&lt;br/&gt;FK assignment_id&lt;br/&gt;FK student_id&lt;br/&gt;attempt_no, status&lt;br/&gt;started_at, deadline_at, submitted_at&lt;br/&gt;auto_score, max_score, final_score" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=13;fillColor=#ffe4e6;strokeColor=#64748b;fontColor=#172033;fontSize=13;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="890" y="386" width="300" height="192" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e7" value="&lt;b&gt;attempt_answers&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr/&gt;PK id&lt;br/&gt;FK attempt_id&lt;br/&gt;FK assignment_question_id&lt;br/&gt;assignment_id (consistency)&lt;br/&gt;answer, is_correct&lt;br/&gt;score_awarded, grading_detail" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=13;fillColor=#ffe4e6;strokeColor=#64748b;fontColor=#172033;fontSize=13;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="653" width="300" height="192" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e8" value="&lt;b&gt;score_adjustments&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr/&gt;PK id&lt;br/&gt;FK attempt_id&lt;br/&gt;old_score, new_score&lt;br/&gt;reason, FK adjusted_by&lt;br/&gt;adjusted_at" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=13;fillColor=#ffe4e6;strokeColor=#64748b;fontColor=#172033;fontSize=13;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="480" y="653" width="300" height="168" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e9" value="&lt;b&gt;users&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr/&gt;PK id&lt;br/&gt;full_name" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=13;fillColor=#dbeafe;strokeColor=#64748b;fontColor=#172033;fontSize=13;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="890" y="653" width="300" height="118" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="l0" value="1:N" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#64748b;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#334155;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;endArrow=ERmany;endFill=0;startArrow=ERone;startFill=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="e1" target="e3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="l1" value="1:N" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#64748b;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#334155;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;endArrow=ERmany;endFill=0;startArrow=ERone;startFill=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="e2" target="e3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="l2" value="1:N" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#64748b;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#334155;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;endArrow=ERmany;endFill=0;startArrow=ERone;startFill=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="e3" target="e4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="l3" value="1:N" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#64748b;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#334155;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;endArrow=ERmany;endFill=0;startArrow=ERone;startFill=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="e3" target="e5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="l4" value="1:N" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#64748b;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#334155;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;endArrow=ERmany;endFill=0;startArrow=ERone;startFill=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="e3" target="e6"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="l5" value="1:N" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#64748b;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#334155;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;endArrow=ERmany;endFill=0;startArrow=ERone;startFill=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="e6" target="e7"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="l6" value="1:N" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#64748b;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#334155;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;endArrow=ERmany;endFill=0;startArrow=ERone;startFill=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="e4" target="e7"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="l7" value="1:N" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#64748b;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#334155;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;endArrow=ERmany;endFill=0;startArrow=ERone;startFill=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="e6" target="e8"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="l8" value="1:N" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#64748b;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#334155;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;endArrow=ERmany;endFill=0;startArrow=ERone;startFill=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="e9" target="e6"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="l9" value="1:N" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#64748b;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#334155;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;endArrow=ERmany;endFill=0;startArrow=ERone;startFill=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="e9" target="e5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="verbal_note_erd-6" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:17px;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:14px;&quot;&gt;GIAO BÀI, NỘP BÀI, CHẤM ĐIỂM&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:1.65;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:12px;&quot;&gt;• Một exercise có thể tạo nhiều assignments cho nhiều lớp hoặc giao nhiều lần cho cùng lớp.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:12px;&quot;&gt;• assignment_questions lưu bản chụp JSON của câu hỏi, đáp án và điểm khi giao; tránh thay đổi đề cũ.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:12px;&quot;&gt;• assignment_overrides lưu gia hạn và số lượt làm bổ sung riêng cho từng học sinh.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:12px;&quot;&gt;• attempts lưu từng lượt làm của học sinh: IN_PROGRESS → SUBMITTED hoặc AUTO_SUBMITTED.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:12px;&quot;&gt;• attempt_answers lưu câu trả lời và điểm từng câu; score_adjustments lưu lịch sử giáo viên sửa điểm.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:12px;&quot;&gt;• Điểm bảng điểm = điểm final_score cao nhất trong các lượt đã nộp hợp lệ.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:12px;&quot;&gt;• Khi hết giờ/hạn, server tự nộp câu đã lưu. Cần kiểm tra attempt và câu hỏi thuộc cùng assignment.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F1F5F9;strokeColor=#94A3B8;fontColor=#0F172A;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=18;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeome